  "summary": "The theme-verifier HTML and anchor checks look sound. Two kinds of translation edits are wrong. First, error-invalid-multivalued-size in the account-ui and admin-ui JS bundles moved from i18next `{{n}}` placeholders to Java MessageFormat `{n}`/choice syntax, which i18next cannot read, so users see raw placeholders. Second, two translations are in the wrong language: the Lithuanian files got an Italian sentence, and the Simplified-Chinese account bundle got Traditional characters. I also have two minor suggestions: name the key and file in the anchor-mismatch message, and add a passing test case.",
